"""
Premium Villa - Crypto Payments module (payments.py)
Now powered by OxaPay's White Label Merchant API:
  - every order gets its OWN address + timer (no more "2 buyers, same amount"
    collisions, no more asking buyers to paste a transaction hash)
  - the bot polls OxaPay for payment status and updates the message in place
  - buyer never leaves Telegram / never sees oxapay.com

Uses raw API for ALL displays to support animated emojis (unchanged from
the previous version).
"""

